{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I meet people in a new country?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Orientation week events, course seminars, and university clubs are the fastest route to making friends as a new international student."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"What if I have a problem with my accommodation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Contact your university's accommodation or international student office first, since they can mediate with landlords more effectively than a new arrival can alone."}},
